// BMS ECU — board layer.
//
// Inherits our corrected S32K388 chip description. Deliberately near-empty:
// because sensor values are injected at variable level (PROJECT.md §6), there
// is nothing board-specific left for the emulator to model. The file exists
// anyway so a real customer board has somewhere to put its additions, and so
// every node on the canvas maps to a board file of its own.
//
// Peripherals this node uses, by their REAL Renode names:
//   can0     CAN.S32K3XX_FlexCAN @ 0x40304000  (Zephyr calls this flexcan0)
//   lpuart2  UART.NXP_LPUART     @ 0x40330000  (Zephyr's console for this board)
//
// Those names are recorded in harness/boards.yml and read from there. They
// never appear in engine code.
using "../cpus/s32k388.repl"
